"数据放在 iCloud 云盘的「Timeline」文件夹，日常只传变更，草稿不同步。增量同步需要各设备更新到最新版。" = "Data is stored in the Timeline folder in iCloud Drive. Only changes transfer during regular sync. Drafts do not sync. Update Timeline on all devices to use incremental sync.";
"部分原图尚未下载，备份未完成。请联网等待图片下载后重试。" = "Some originals have not downloaded, so the backup is incomplete. Connect to the internet, wait for images to download, and try again.";

