"顶栏的云图标表示修改已存在本机、iCloud 还没确认上传，传完后自动消失；对方是否收到，请查看下方设备接收确认。" = "The cloud icon in the top bar means your edits are saved on this device and iCloud hasn't confirmed the upload yet. It goes away once they're uploaded. Check the device receipts below to confirm delivery.";
