"提醒在这台设备收到任务更新后安排。后台刷新由系统决定；临近提醒时间时，请打开应用确认同步及提醒权限。" = "Reminders are scheduled after this device receives task updates. Background refresh is controlled by iOS; open the app to confirm sync and permissions before an imminent reminder.";
"提醒在本机收到任务更新后安排；其他设备离线或未同步时，提醒可能尚未安排。" = "Reminders are scheduled after this device receives task updates. Offline devices or pending sync may delay scheduling.";
